{
"file": 31,
"paths": [
"d002/f641"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "f9a7181a",
"en_raw": "A cat in a bottle, huh..."
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "c8fb7860",
"en_raw": "That's quite an extreme story"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "b30657e5",
"en_raw": "Oh, right, there's a novel"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "8a0a2097",
"en_raw": "called Hell in a Bottle..."
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "c5446d97",
"en_raw": "Stop it, Sango"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "3df1416a",
"en_raw": "It's not something to talk about lightly"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "5a4a2393",
"en_raw": "If it stays buried"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "fb9d2266",
"en_raw": "the cat will die, you know?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "81aa5fee",
"en_raw": "And not just die"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "27bc717b",
"en_raw": "In a bottle"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "6462eb3f",
"en_raw": "it can't return to the earth even rotting"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "4818dd2f",
"en_raw": "and in there is a goo that"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "ae3a2508",
"en_raw": "was once a cat..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "60f9063e",
"en_raw": "Sango!"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "fa8eb9e0",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "606f6260",
"en_raw": "You're still going to look for it?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "e00d6efc",
"en_raw": "You're brave"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "d57d9ffa",
"en_raw": "Right, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "6677278a",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "f9223a58",
"en_raw": "Nao, you're amazing"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "ad2105f7",
"en_raw": "Anyway, let's go"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "debdd779",
"en_raw": "to the Tama riverbank once"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "e7abfd91",
"en_raw": "It bugs me to do nothing at all"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "9700faa8",
"en_raw": "about what I was asked..."
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "412b7b75",
"en_raw": "Well, why not?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "cd9c3053",
"en_raw": "If we go once"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "90ec591a",
"en_raw": "our duty's done, right?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "3c30e240",
"en_raw": "...There really are idiots who do it seriously"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "316db836",
"en_raw": "I'll hunt down the culprit"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "fa8eb9e0",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "6f446d53",
"en_raw": "Can't we ask Sanjo for a bit"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "f8cc64d6",
"en_raw": "more detail?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "9d77836a",
"en_raw": "Like the situation when she found it..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "6f799efc",
"en_raw": "...Nao, are you listening?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "cf7f4b2a",
"en_raw": "Uh, ah, yeah"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "34663c18",
"en_raw": "Weird"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "e4d3100b",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "5452b7ab",
"en_raw": "Um... but"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "b935233e",
"en_raw": "there must be some reason..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "ab990316",
"en_raw": "What reason?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "1cb6cb62",
"en_raw": "Whoever it was and whatever reason"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "bbfaa0a5",
"en_raw": "that's something you must not"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "0302ee68",
"en_raw": "do as a human being"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "a709753d",
"en_raw": "...Or what?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "5c7f19df",
"en_raw": "Nao, do you know something?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "a627791a",
"en_raw": "Not really..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "f07c5c94",
"en_raw": "It's not like that, but"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "d93f79d5",
"en_raw": "...Hmm"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "7f956e5b",
"en_raw": "What"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "b0887d9b",
"en_raw": "that NM and KS are an item?"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "7164193d",
"en_raw": "When Nao lies"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "4299a0df",
"en_raw": "he blinks a whole lot more"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "cba0f4c7",
"en_raw": "Oh well"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "c896abfb",
"en_raw": "We just need to catch them in the act"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "0cd46095",
"en_raw": "I'll definitely catch them"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "9920e4c9",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango, um..."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "7b8293d2",
"en_raw": "I'm the one who heard this rumor"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "8090e9af",
"en_raw": "so can you leave it to me?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "2e9abd27",
"en_raw": "Nao, are you confident"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "de675dc2",
"en_raw": "you can get to the bottom of it?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "56e0244f",
"en_raw": "Well..."
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "f98c4c6b",
"en_raw": "But I'll manage somehow"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "965879cf",
"en_raw": "Somehow, huh..."
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "35f089fd",
"en_raw": "...Suspicious"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "764a28ec",
"en_raw": "...What is?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "ad8312db",
"en_raw": "is obvious"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "42358eea",
"en_raw": "Your timid friend"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "abd130b9",
"en_raw": "Segawa wouldn't... do that"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "6f829bff",
"en_raw": "...kind of thing"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "b87c9c60",
"en_raw": "Hmm..."
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "72b15040",
"en_raw": "So you do have a guess"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "ada7d231",
"en_raw": "Why do you say that?"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "6d296116",
"en_raw": "Didn't I tell you?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "ed3c8fda",
"en_raw": "When Nao lies"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "24dab569",
"en_raw": "his blinking increases"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "8c30543e",
"en_raw": "If Nao can't say"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "cc41f763",
"en_raw": "I'll just ask the person"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "7ca90b61",
"en_raw": "He's probably at the Tama riverbank"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "130f71cf",
"en_raw": "today too"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "ce05db49",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango..."
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "7a550d61",
"en_raw": "Nao, you seem"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "6c72f2e2",
"en_raw": "to have noticed something"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "3541b10c",
"en_raw": "but if you cover for someone"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "ff020c10",
"en_raw": "I won't forgive you"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "c6195e03",
"en_raw": "Until I've cornered"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "cb44a355",
"en_raw": "the real culprit"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "6c6265e2",
"en_raw": "Saving a cat again..."
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "8abb22d6",
"en_raw": "Why do we"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "99d83f59",
"en_raw": "have to do this"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "ec733267",
"en_raw": "kind of thing, I wonder"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "53b71742",
"en_raw": "The cause is that Kume guy"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "76a294d3",
"en_raw": "the dangerous one, right?"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "6194db60",
"en_raw": "Kume is a problem, sure"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "7ead3985",
"en_raw": "but the people around him are bad too"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "7ae6678f",
"en_raw": "Those guys are especially"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "5ac94d66",
"en_raw": "cruel to Kume"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "3670a1e7",
"en_raw": "If you want the real cause"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "5b671346",
"en_raw": "it's definitely that"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "eaa92595",
"en_raw": "Thinking of it as the top-ranked"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "a34b7ef0",
"en_raw": "excellent class"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "5d399ef0",
"en_raw": "what does that mean?"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "bbc3b728",
"en_raw": "Compared to this"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "c06df151",
"en_raw": "the Toilet Gang is cuter"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "ae9ed1c5",
"en_raw": "If you don't like it"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "46776c6a",
"en_raw": "you don't have to come along"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "05e0657b",
"en_raw": "I'll handle it myself..."
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "4b00abbd",
"en_raw": "I didn't say that"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "8b82be8b",
"en_raw": "I just think you should choose"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "374cb2cc",
"en_raw": "your friends a bit more carefully"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "c0163b04",
"en_raw": "that's all"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "8b157252",
"en_raw": "After saving the cat"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "4a3575b7",
"en_raw": "you're meeting Segawa, right?"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "d0069239",
"en_raw": "But that guy will surely"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "114f3bda",
"en_raw": "be made to do it again"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "51b4b885",
"en_raw": "Meow meow, it's tough too, meow"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "49b58a3d",
"en_raw": "So today it's Segawa and me"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "04e14a73",
"en_raw": "thinking of ways to stop Kume"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "3ff613b8",
"en_raw": "Change of plan"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "0706ac6f",
"en_raw": "Wait behind the schoolhouse"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "91b4cec7",
"en_raw": "Behind the school, alone, huh..."
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "fc41ea8c",
"en_raw": "I wonder if something happened to Segawa"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "28b432dc",
"en_raw": "More importantly, Nao"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "03a7305d",
"en_raw": "you'd better be careful"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "04b6e67d",
"en_raw": "I can't tell whose handwriting this is"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "58240f6b",
"en_raw": "It doesn't have to be Segawa's"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "23cb2c23",
"en_raw": "You think so too, Sango"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "3ff613b8",
"en_raw": "Change of plan"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "0706ac6f",
"en_raw": "Wait behind the schoolhouse"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "aac06dcb",
"en_raw": "We should confirm who's calling us"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "7ca91802",
"en_raw": "I'm the one being called"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "3e0ca495",
"en_raw": "Sango, don't get in the way"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "9b617e95",
"en_raw": "There's a place I want to stop by"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "9ed65ba4",
"en_raw": "is that okay?"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "b2610665",
"en_raw": "what is it?"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "59b900e7",
"en_raw": "I want to make a phone call"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "8e2c0813",
"en_raw": "About the other day..."
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "567781c4",
"en_raw": "Segawa was really"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "24e1738d",
"en_raw": "scared..."
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "b530db82",
"en_raw": "Don't do it at home"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "2db322cf",
"en_raw": "I don't want my mom to hear"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "08e6a247",
"en_raw": "Don't want anyone to hear, huh"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "7012cdc1",
"en_raw": "Then how about the phone booth"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "b5014507",
"en_raw": "along Koshu Kaido?"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "8dadc779",
"en_raw": "Yeah, thanks..."
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "b0ff1abd",
"en_raw": "I have to call Segawa"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "132a3f8b",
"en_raw": "If you want somewhere nobody's around"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "7012cdc1",
"en_raw": "Then how about the phone booth"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "7c38706b",
"en_raw": "I recommend the phone booth"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "9726e99b",
"en_raw": "Ugh, somehow"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "54092d52",
"en_raw": "it's even more tense than before"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "c3a4563b",
"en_raw": "Why did it turn out like this?"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "7e0b4261",
"en_raw": "...That's right"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "033aec16",
"en_raw": "Back then, Sango showed up"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "17cab34e",
"en_raw": "and egged us on..."
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "4b564fb6",
"en_raw": "I helped you out"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "ca8b7b77",
"en_raw": "and you say that?"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "7bd1321b",
"en_raw": "Well, setting that aside"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "7b6ea872",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "b9afbd3d",
"en_raw": "let me say one thing"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "7b21f876",
"en_raw": "This time, this was for the best"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "357d91d8",
"en_raw": "The best possible outcome"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "1d55ca25",
"en_raw": "yes, perfect"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "6ac58c92",
"en_raw": "For Sango, you mean..."
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "8a18dcdd",
"en_raw": "No, you see"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "ec96e87e",
"en_raw": "Nao, you"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "7875cf08",
"en_raw": "think you can get along"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "225b2219",
"en_raw": "with everyone, right?"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "dde6236f",
"en_raw": "That's a huge mistake"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "9ed7fd8a",
"en_raw": "Sadly, in this world"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "d7cba2d7",
"en_raw": "there are people who take advantage"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "5e123179",
"en_raw": "of that softness"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "9572b1b7",
"en_raw": "Yuasa, for example"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "d01c4797",
"en_raw": "So this was for the best"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "daf44bfa",
"en_raw": "Not everyone"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "bc840e44",
"en_raw": "has to force themselves to be friends"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "b0f37ef7",
"en_raw": "right?"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "67981027",
"en_raw": "Right, Shiina!"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "248e66bc",
"en_raw": "Yeah, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "9b11f87e",
"en_raw": "Everybody is friends!"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "d8cbe108",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Cat in a Bottle"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "098deae1",
"en_raw": "And after that"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "d1a33956",
"en_raw": "how's it going?"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "31df6354",
"en_raw": "How's what going?"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "196af51c",
"en_raw": "The friendship"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "f6c50868",
"en_raw": "of the bullied trio"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "3c96ce86",
"en_raw": "...Segawa and Kume"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "45ae5322",
"en_raw": "are fine"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "03959c2a",
"en_raw": "Why do I have to be told"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "452cc1e2",
"en_raw": "that by Sango, anyway?"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "4eadf3df",
"en_raw": "I'm worried about you and this is what I get"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "c86e6953",
"en_raw": "That doesn't sound like worry at all"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "14316cda",
"en_raw": "I just don't get it"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "e302ff04",
"en_raw": "I mean"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "bec9c22b",
"en_raw": "if you were friends with"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "a06c8231",
"en_raw": "Takayuki Nishi or someone"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "2683de17",
"en_raw": "you'd definitely benefit..."
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "627b2359",
"en_raw": "None of your business"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "ae2d2acf",
"en_raw": "Mind your own business"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}